    "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
    "seconds": 17,
    "summary": "The root cause was the `adFailure` feature flag in the `flagd-config` ConfigMap. Its `defaultVariant` was `\"on\"`, so the ad service was being forced to fail. Every other flag was already `\"off\"`.\n\nI set `adFailure` back to `\"off\"` and restarted the `flagd` and `ad` deployments so they pick up the change.\n\nI haven't checked that the pods come back healthy or that the ad service now responds correctly. Before the restart, all pods were Running.",
